{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_38_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_38","textTraditional":"一、九年，春，齊人殺無知。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_38_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_38","textTraditional":"二、公及齊大夫盟于暨。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_38_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_38","textTraditional":"公曷為與大夫盟？齊無君也。然則何以不名？其諱與大夫盟也，使若眾然。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_38_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_38","textTraditional":"三、夏，公伐齊納糾。齊小白入于齊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_38_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_38","textTraditional":"納者何？入辭也。其言伐之何？伐而言納者，猶不能納也。糾者何？公子糾也。何以不稱公子？君前臣名也。齊小白入于齊。曷為以國氏？當國也。其言入何？篡辭也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_38_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_38","textTraditional":"四、秋，七月丁酉，葬齊襄公。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_38_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_38","textTraditional":"五、八月庚申，及齊師戰于乾時，我師敗績。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_38_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_38","textTraditional":"內不言敗，此其言敗何？伐敗也。曷為伐敗？復讎也。此復讎乎大國，曷為使微者？公也。公則曷為不言公？不與公復讎也。曷為不與公復讎？復讎者在下也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_38_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_38","textTraditional":"六、九月，齊人取子糾殺之。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_38_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_38","textTraditional":"其取之何？內辭也；脅我，使我殺之也。其稱子糾何？貴也。其貴奈何？宜為君者也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_38_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_38","textTraditional":"七、冬，浚洙。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_38_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_38","textTraditional":"洙者何？水也。浚之者何？深之也。曷為深之？畏齊也。曷為畏齊也？辭殺子糾也。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}